MSIX/
.reference/

# Scratch tooling kept outside the source distribution
.tools/

# Native PUB template samples are user content and stay on a maintainer's disk:
# they are never committed. The pattern is recursive, because samples kept in a
# subfolder of examples/ would otherwise slip past it. The evidence tests verify against
# their real bytes when present, and tests/TestSampleSupport.cs writes synthetic
# containers of the same shape when they are not. What the samples taught us is written
# up in docs/SAMPLE_FINDINGS.md; the files themselves are not the licence's "source".
examples/**/*.dta

# Private keys and PKCS#12 bundles must never enter the repository. Only the public certificate of
# the code-signing key recorded in packaging/CertumSigning.settings.json is published
# (tools/signing/*.cer); a card-backed key is never exportable, so nothing here could hold one.
*.pfx
*.pkcs12
*.p12
*.csr
*.pvk
*.spc
*.snk
